{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill with You : Lo-Fi Story is a work-focused sound novel game where you work at your desk alongside Satone, an imaginative girl who loves writing novels. Customize the Lofi music, ambient sounds, and scenery that reflect Satone\u2019s emotions to enhance your focus! The more time you spend working together, the deeper your bond will grow\u2014perhaps you\u2019ll even connect with Satone on a deeper level\u2026?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/extras/3d19549ab2399a7507fb63d8718ea3d4.poster.avif?t=1773930972\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/extras/3d19549ab2399a7507fb63d8718ea3d4.webm?t=1773930972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/extras/3d19549ab2399a7507fb63d8718ea3d4.mp4?t=1773930972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NEWS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've added macOS support \u2014 thanks to your many requests! (May 13, 2025)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Emotionally Expressive Music to Maximize Focus</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to relax and work at a leisurely pace or boost your motivation with emotionally engaging melodies, <i>Chill Talk</i> offers a variety of original songs tailored for different work scenarios.<br>Immerse yourself in deep focus while listening to high-quality music from talented sound artists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/extras/8867198ed92a34de64e3bb1336fef3ef.avif?t=1773930972\" width=640 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Wide Variety of Nature Sounds to Awaken Your Instincts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, it\u2019s best to turn off the music and listen to the soothing sounds of nature. Let the sound of wind, rain, and other natural elements sharpen your senses and create a deeply immersive work environment.<br>Customize the ambient sounds to suit your preferences.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/extras/25213b39881660dc5655583d994db6c2.poster.avif?t=1773930972\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/extras/25213b39881660dc5655583d994db6c2.webm?t=1773930972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pomodoro Timer for Maximum Productivity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up a Pomodoro timer before you start working to manage your break times effectively. Taking short, regular breaks helps maintain maximum concentration and efficiency.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/extras/f0d32b2b8f2bfdbb85907a22269b1971.poster.avif?t=1773930972\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/extras/f0d32b2b8f2bfdbb85907a22269b1971.webm?t=1773930972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/extras/f0d32b2b8f2bfdbb85907a22269b1971.mp4?t=1773930972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Satone\u2019s Hidden Feelings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your break, take time to interact with Satone. The \u201cprecious moments\u201d you share while working together will deepen your relationship, and if you build enough trust, she may eventually open her heart to you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/extras/cd12e50df0a94137413e6cb1d48aa169.poster.avif?t=1773930972\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/extras/cd12e50df0a94137413e6cb1d48aa169.webm?t=1773930972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/extras/cd12e50df0a94137413e6cb1d48aa169.mp4?t=1773930972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Nice to Meet You!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3548580/2be6298d86415ed2542750cb2919d6512cca1ed9.jpg"},{"name":"Task Complete!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3548580/ee0a1162915dc9cc5ab68fe8652fcdb85511489d.jpg"},{"name":"Whew, Good Job!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3548580/2a4c70a8944989e2a89a4f3c56c800c1471c6d6a.jpg"},{"name":"Small Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3548580/8a46c7b09035d2109b6a3e813f880868062e0d55.jpg"},{"name":"Everyday Moments","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3548580/537c7ac641c76370a639ae846f863e145cf21f73.jpg"},{"name":"Oh, Your Favorite Song?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3548580/375b0bd9de797106a03c736b514707ed3202f0d2.jpg"},{"name":"Work with Your Favorite Background!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3548580/ac302bb5834eb1eb1f70d1d6576b3cd77bd6f001.jpg"},{"name":"Partner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3548580/12e3edffde46a2212259bd33e15c72a23d0d